    "body": "\"read-only zero\" is standard terminology in this manual (it shows up 102 times) and it means exactly this.  If it's confusing here, then presumably it's confusing everywhere, and the right thing to do would seem to define it somewhere central.  But that should be a matter for a different PR.",
